factbook_resolve.task:
CURRENT FACTBOOK:
{factbook}

ANSWERS to some of its open questions (question, then the person's answer):
{answers}

Return the complete updated factbook markdown.

fact_add.task:
RAW TEXT:
{text}

Return the atomic fact bullet line(s).

profile_skills_build.task:
CANDIDATE SKILL FACTS (JSON list of strings):
{facts}

Return JSON: {"skills": [{"label": "...", "items": "a, b, c"}]}

block_prompts.headline:
Tailor the resume HEADLINE (the pipe-separated line under the name) to the job below.
{depth}
Rules: 3-4 segments, mirror the target role, no invented skills.

JOB DESCRIPTION:
{jd}

EXTRA INSTRUCTIONS: {extra}

CURRENT HEADLINE:
{content}

Return JSON: {"headline": "...", "gaps": ["..."]}

block_prompts.summary:
Tailor the resume SUMMARY (the short intro paragraph) to the job below.
{depth}
Rules: ~90 words max, human voice, 3-4 **bold** accents (use **double asterisks**), no buzzword stacking, every claim traceable to the current summary + the fact notes.

JOB DESCRIPTION:
{jd}

EXTRA INSTRUCTIONS: {extra}

CURRENT SUMMARY:
{content}

FACT NOTES (do not exceed these):
{facts}

Return JSON: {"summary": "...", "gaps": ["..."]}

block_prompts.skills:
Reorder / re-emphasise the SKILLS clusters to lead with what the job below weighs most. You may reorder clusters and items and drop the least relevant, but add nothing not already present.
{depth}

JOB DESCRIPTION:
{jd}

EXTRA INSTRUCTIONS: {extra}

CURRENT CLUSTERS (JSON list of {label, items}):
{content}

Return JSON: {"clusters": [{"label": "...", "items": "..."}], "gaps": ["..."]}

block_prompts.bullets:
Select, order, and reword the BULLETS for one role to fit the job below. You may ONLY use the candidate bullets provided - reorder, reword within the depth limit, and pick the best {max_bullets} - but invent no new facts, numbers, or technologies.
{depth}

JOB DESCRIPTION:
{jd}

EXTRA INSTRUCTIONS: {extra}

CANDIDATE BULLETS (JSON list of strings; **double asterisks** mark existing bold accents - keep the accents):
{content}

Return JSON: {"bullets": ["...", "..."], "gaps": ["..."]}

block_prompts.feedback:
The user reviewed the tailored resume and gave feedback. Apply it, obeying all guardrails. Change only what the feedback asks.

USER FEEDBACK:
{feedback}

CURRENT TAILORED CONTENT (JSON matching the resume schema):
{content}

Return the full updated content as JSON in the SAME schema. No prose outside the JSON.
